Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20integrate=20real=20ENSA=20K=C3=A9nitra?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Formations=20module?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace the hard-coded MajorController data with a full Formations
module backed by the database (Formation model + migration + seeder)
populated with 8 real ENSA Kénitra programs scraped from
ensa.uit.ac.ma, including the full program, skills, career paths,
and admission conditions for 'Réseaux et Systèmes de Télécommunications'.

- Add /formations index and /formations/{slug} detail pages
- New Formation model, migration, and seeder
- MajorController is now a thin compatibility layer that maps old
  slugs (used by the home page) to the new formation slugs via 301
- Navbar gains a 'Formations' link
- Home page major cards point directly at the new formation URLs
- Title default updated to 'EduBlog - ENSA Kénitra'
- Views rebuilt to match the existing mint-green glassmorphism
  design system (no Bootstrap dependency)
